 is tinted red to subtly reflect the red in the original six-color Apple logo.", "identifier": "components-pull-down-buttons-thumbnail.png", "type": "image", "variants": [{"traits": ["2x", "light"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/components-pull-down-buttons-thumbnail@2x.png"}, {"traits": ["2x", "dark"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/components-pull-down-buttons-thumbnail~dark@2x.png"}]}, "components.png": {"alt": "", "identifier": "components.png", "type": "image", "variants": [{"traits": ["2x", "light"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/components@2x.png"}, {"traits": ["2x", "dark"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/components~dark@2x.png"}]}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/action-sheets": {"abstract": [{"text": "An action sheet is a modal view that presents choices related to an action people initiate.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/action-sheets", "images": [{"identifier": "components-action-sheets-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Action sheets", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/action-sheets"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/buttons": {"abstract": [{"text": "A button initiates an instantaneous action.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/buttons", "images": [{"identifier": "components-buttons-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Buttons", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/buttons"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/components": {"abstract": [{"text": "Learn how to use and customize system-defined components to give people a familiar and consistent experience.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/components", "images": [{"identifier": "overview.svg", "type": "icon"}, {"identifier": "components.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "collectionGroup", "title": "Components", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/components"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/icons": {"abstract": [{"text": "An effective icon is a graphic asset that expresses a single concept in ways people instantly understand.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/icons", "images": [{"identifier": "icons.svg", "type": "icon"}, {"identifier": "foundations-icons-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Icons", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/icons"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/menus": {"abstract": [{"text": "A menu reveals its options when people interact with it, making it a space-efficient way to present commands in your app or game.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/menus", "images": [{"identifier": "components-menus-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Menus", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/menus"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/menus-and-actions": {"abstract": [], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/menus-and-actions", "images": [{"identifier": "menus-and-actions.svg", "type": "icon"}, {"identifier": "components-menus-and-actions-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "collectionGroup", "title": "Menus and actions", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/menus-and-actions"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/pop-up-buttons": {"abstract": [{"text": "A pop-up button displays a menu of mutually exclusive options.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/pop-up-buttons", "images": [{"identifier": "components-pop-up-buttons-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Pop-up buttons", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/pop-up-buttons"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/popovers": {"abstract": [{"text": "A popover is a transient view that appears above other content when people click or tap a control or interactive area.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/popovers", "images": [{"identifier": "components-popovers-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Popovers", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/popovers"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/sf-symbols": {"abstract": [{"text": "SF Symbols provides thousands of consistent, highly configurable symbols that integrate seamlessly with the San Francisco system font, automatically aligning with text in all weights and sizes.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/sf-symbols", "images": [{"identifier": "sf-symbols.svg", "type": "icon"}, {"identifier": "foundations-sf-symbols-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "SF Symbols", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/sf-symbols"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/human-interface-guidelines": {"abstract": [{"text": "The HIG contains guidance and best practices that can help you design a", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "great experience for any Apple platform.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/human-interface-guidelines", "images": [{"identifier": "human-interface-guidelines-page-image-card.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "collection", "title": "Human Interface Guidelines", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines"}, "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/AppKit/NSPopUpButton/pullsDown": {"abstract": [{"text": "A Boolean value indicating whether the button displays a pull-down or pop-up menu.", "type": "text"}], "fragments": [{"kind": "keyword", "text": "var"}, {"kind": "text", "text": " "}, {"kind": "identifier", "text": "pullsDown"}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": "}, {"kind": "typeIdentifier", "preciseIdentifier": "s:Sb", "text": "Bool"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/AppKit/NSPopUpButton/pullsDown", "kind": "symbol", "role": "symbol", "title": "pullsDown", "type": "topic", "url": "/documentation/appkit/nspopupbutton/pullsdown"}, "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/SwiftUI/MenuPickerStyle": {"abstract": [{"text": "A picker style that presents the options as a menu when the user presses a", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "button, or as a submenu when nested within a larger menu.", "type": "text"}], "fragments": [{"kind": "keyword", "text": "struct"}, {"kind": "text", "text": " "}, {"kind": "identifier", "text": "MenuPickerStyle"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/SwiftUI/MenuPickerStyle", "kind": "symbol", "navigatorTitle": [{"kind": "identifier", "text": "MenuPickerStyle"}], "role": "symbol", "title": "MenuPickerStyle", "type": "topic", "url": "/documentation/swiftui/menupickerstyle"}, "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/UIKit/UIControl/showsMenuAsPrimaryAction": {"abstract": [{"text": "A Boolean value that determines whether the context menu interaction is the control\u2019s primary action.", "type": "text"}], "fragments": [{"kind": "keyword", "text": "var"}, {"kind": "text", "text": " "}, {"kind": "identifier", "text": "showsMenuAsPrimaryAction"}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": "}, {"kind": "typeIdentifier", "preciseIdentifier": "s:Sb", "text": "Bool"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/UIKit/UIControl/showsMenuAsPrimaryAction", "kind": "symbol", "role": "symbol", "title": "showsMenuAsPrimaryAction", "type": "topic", "url": "/documentation/uikit/uicontrol/showsmenuasprimaryaction"}, "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/technologies": {"abstract": [], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/technologies", "kind": "technologies", "role": "overview", "title": "Technologies", "type": "topic", "url": "/documentation/technologies"}, "foundations-icons-thumbnail.png": {"alt": "A sketch of the Command key icon. The image is tinted yellow to subtly reflect the yellow in the original six-color Apple logo.", "identifier": "foundations-icons-thumbnail.png", "type": "image", "variants": [{"traits": ["2x", "light"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/foundations-icons-thumbnail@2x.png"}, {"traits": ["2x", "dark"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/foundations-icons-thumbnail~dark@2x.png"}]}, "foundations-sf-symbols-thumbnail.png": {"alt": "A sketch of the SF Symbols icon. The image is tinted yellow to subtly reflect the yellow in the original six-color Apple logo.", "identifier": "foundations-sf-symbols-thumbnail.png", "type": "image", "variants": [{"traits": ["2x", "light"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/foundations-sf-symbols-thumbnail@2x.png"}, {"traits": ["2x", "dark"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/foundations-sf-symbols-thumbnail~dark@2x.png"}]}, "human-interface-guidelines-page-image-card.png": {"alt": "An illustration of several Liquid Glass components such as toggles, sliders, and buttons, atop a neutral background. The transparent components cast shadows on the background and allow their colored elements, like a blue slider track and a green toggle backing, to show through, highlighting the Liquid Glass material's lensing effect.", "identifier": "human-interface-guidelines-page-image-card.png", "type": "image", "variants": [{"traits": ["2x", "light"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/human-interface-guidelines-page-image-card@2x.png"}]}, "icons.svg": {"alt": "The Command key icon.", "identifier": "icons.svg", "type": "image", "variants": 